# Hardware Details

## Components Used

* ESP32 Development Board
* GSM Module (SIM800L / SIM900)
* Ultrasonic Sensor (HC-SR04)
* PIR Sensor (HC-SR501)
* Moisture Sensor
* Servo Motor (SG90/MG90)
* 16x2 LCD Display (I2C)
* Current & Voltage Sensor (INA219)
* Solar Panel (10W, 12V)
* Lithium-Ion Battery (3.7V, 2200mAh)
* TP4056 Charging Module
* DC-DC Boost Converter (5V Output)
* Jumper Wires, Connectors

---

## Connections

* Ultrasonic Sensor → TRIG: GPIO 5, ECHO: GPIO 18
* PIR Sensor → OUT: GPIO 19
* Moisture Sensor → AO: GPIO 34
* Servo Motor → Signal: GPIO 25
* LCD (I2C) → SDA: GPIO 21, SCL: GPIO 22
* GSM Module → TX: GPIO 17, RX: GPIO 16
* INA219 Sensor → SDA: GPIO 21, SCL: GPIO 22

---

## Power Connections

* Solar Panel → TP4056 Charging Module
* TP4056 → Lithium-Ion Battery
* Battery → DC-DC Boost Converter
* Converter Output (5V) → ESP32 & Components

---

